      "sourceTextSha256": "8e14f9b364dec6a38b2e858c94819c9a634c8e28652c4c25504b0174a13e0e59",
      "text": "In the afternoon, discover Cartagena, where colonial architecture, history and Caribbean charm come together. Explore Bocagrande, Castillogrande and Manga before visiting La Popa Monastery and San Felipe de Barajas Castle.\n\nContinue on foot through the historic centre, discovering its colourful streets, picturesque squares and emblematic landmarks, including the Clock Tower, Plaza de los Coches, Plaza de Santo Domingo, Santa Catalina Cathedral, the Palace of the Inquisition and the city walls. The tour concludes at Las Bóvedas, a former military complex now home to an artisan market, before returning to the hotel.",
